WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.947
=Episode 29=

01:55.479 --> 01:55.960
Here.

01:58.039 --> 01:58.640
You go first.

01:58.640 --> 01:59.319
I'll go first.

01:59.479 --> 02:00.319
Horizontal.

02:01.319 --> 02:02.039
Seven.

02:02.080 --> 02:02.479
One,

02:02.479 --> 02:02.880
two,

02:02.880 --> 02:03.240
three,

02:03.240 --> 02:03.720
four,

02:03.720 --> 02:04.160
five,

02:04.160 --> 02:04.720
six,

02:04.720 --> 02:05.160
seven.

02:07.559 --> 02:08.920
Give the other person a kiss.

02:09.040 --> 02:10.640
What is it? Let me see.

02:10.640 --> 02:12.080
Hey, no cheating.

02:12.080 --> 02:12.879
I'm serious.

02:12.879 --> 02:14.080
Let me take a look.

02:14.360 --> 02:15.200
See if it's true.

02:15.200 --> 02:16.547
(Give the other person a kiss.)

02:21.320 --> 02:22.240
I have to kiss you.

02:23.439 --> 02:24.719
You're cheating, aren't you?

02:24.999 --> 02:25.800
I'm not cheating.

02:29.071 --> 02:30.048
Give me that.

02:30.240 --> 02:30.760
Go on.

02:31.040 --> 02:31.559
My turn.

02:32.119 --> 02:33.240
Well, I choose East.

02:33.320 --> 02:34.760
East.

02:35.182 --> 02:35.670
Vertical.

02:35.679 --> 02:36.159
Four times.

02:39.159 --> 02:40.240
Ask a question.

02:40.590 --> 02:42.026
(Ask a question.)
Ask a question?

02:44.559 --> 02:45.240
Fei Ni.

02:46.960 --> 02:47.760
If taking care of me

02:48.960 --> 02:50.480
would cost you
your chance at college,

02:51.271 --> 02:52.782
would you still have done it?

02:53.559 --> 02:54.480
Of course not.

02:58.040 --> 03:00.599
No one knows the future.

03:02.559 --> 03:03.920
At first, I took care of you

03:04.226 --> 03:05.360
so I could get into college.

03:05.599 --> 03:06.640
Then I realized

03:07.760 --> 03:09.800
you mattered just as much as college.

03:10.599 --> 03:11.839
I married you

03:12.399 --> 03:13.599
to get assigned a unit.

03:14.040 --> 03:14.640
But in the end,

03:14.640 --> 03:16.599
that unit meant nothing

03:17.080 --> 03:17.999
when it came to us.

03:21.760 --> 03:22.599
Fang Muyang.

03:24.080 --> 03:25.719
I've realized something.

03:26.599 --> 03:28.080
You're like wild grass.

03:28.599 --> 03:29.839
Nothing special at first glance.

03:30.719 --> 03:32.119
But wherever you're planted,

03:32.399 --> 03:33.920
you always manage to grow.

03:40.679 --> 03:42.439
If I'm grass,

03:43.200 --> 03:44.719
then you're the little flower

03:44.826 --> 03:45.582
right beside it.

03:48.200 --> 03:49.399
My turn.

03:50.839 --> 03:51.279
East.

03:52.559 --> 03:53.320
Vertical.

03:54.439 --> 03:54.920
Four.

03:55.200 --> 03:56.920
One, two, three, four.

03:57.320 --> 03:58.640
Same again. Then ask a question.

03:58.640 --> 03:59.599
Are you happy?

04:00.760 --> 04:02.270
What kind of question is that?

04:02.480 --> 04:03.640
I just want to know.

04:07.879 --> 04:08.480
Fei Ni.

04:10.839 --> 04:12.119
Right now, because I have you,

04:13.920 --> 04:14.920
I'm very happy.

04:22.239 --> 04:22.880
Honestly,

04:23.719 --> 04:24.709
even if

04:24.710 --> 04:26.004
I could make a wish right now,

04:26.560 --> 04:27.960
I wouldn't know what to wish for.

04:30.479 --> 04:31.320
Because

04:32.159 --> 04:33.159
I'm content.

05:04.440 --> 05:05.359
Vice Director.

05:05.760 --> 05:06.680
You wanted to see me?

05:08.440 --> 05:09.000
Fei Ni.

05:10.799 --> 05:11.719
There's something

05:11.719 --> 05:12.719
I need to tell you.

05:14.039 --> 05:15.239
We just received notice

05:15.440 --> 05:18.399
that this year's admissions
to the Worker-Peasant-Soldier University

05:20.182 --> 05:21.200
have been postponed.

05:25.640 --> 05:26.719
Postponed?

05:49.072 --> 05:54.272
(Admission to the Worker-Peasant-Soldier
University: Wang Guojun, Fei Ni.)

06:01.599 --> 06:02.359
(Right now,)

06:02.599 --> 06:03.560
(the policy)

06:03.799 --> 06:05.159
is being adjusted gradually.

06:05.320 --> 06:07.239
A lot of things still aren't finalized.

06:08.399 --> 06:09.200
In short,

06:09.200 --> 06:10.159
this year,

06:10.960 --> 06:12.520
the factory no longer has the quota.

06:57.080 --> 06:57.880
Song.

06:58.919 --> 06:59.880
I...

07:00.799 --> 07:02.560
totally understand
how you feel right now.

07:03.200 --> 07:04.000
And

07:04.399 --> 07:05.520
I feel sorry for you.

07:06.520 --> 07:07.320
But...

07:09.520 --> 07:10.279
feeling bad

07:11.159 --> 07:12.279
won't solve this.

07:13.560 --> 07:15.279
And keeping quiet

07:15.560 --> 07:17.399
won't make it go away.

07:17.799 --> 07:19.080
We're grown men.

07:19.560 --> 07:21.599
You have to take responsibility
for what's yours.

07:28.880 --> 07:29.640
Tengda.

07:30.760 --> 07:32.399
We almost became family.

07:32.960 --> 07:34.359
You've eaten in this house before.

07:34.680 --> 07:35.680
Cut us some slack?

07:35.680 --> 07:37.159
Don't bring up that meal.

07:38.640 --> 07:39.680
Cut you some slack?

07:39.799 --> 07:40.589
If I go easy on you,

07:40.590 --> 07:42.293
I'm the one
who has to make up the money.

07:42.719 --> 07:44.159
If you don't have it, ask your mom.

07:45.399 --> 07:46.479
Don't think

07:46.760 --> 07:47.440
just because

07:47.440 --> 07:48.200
your mom and dad

07:48.479 --> 07:49.880
took the kid and hid,

07:49.880 --> 07:51.239
this is over.

07:53.799 --> 07:56.320
Didn't my mom's money
buy you the Three Big Items?

07:57.599 --> 07:58.680
Then go ask your sister.

07:59.120 --> 08:01.760
Isn't the man
she married pretty capable?

08:02.000 --> 08:03.440
He even outdoes me.

08:04.680 --> 08:07.599
Surely she can come up
with this little bit of money.

08:13.479 --> 08:14.080
Look.

08:14.893 --> 08:16.137
I'll give your family

08:16.359 --> 08:18.120
another way out of this.

08:18.399 --> 08:19.000
Lin Song.

08:20.359 --> 08:21.919
Have your sister, Lin Mei,

08:22.440 --> 08:24.000
divorce Fei Ting

08:24.560 --> 08:25.359
and be with me.

08:26.159 --> 08:27.799
I really like her.

08:28.359 --> 08:30.320
I don't mind
that she's been married before.

08:31.279 --> 08:32.879
As long as we become family,

08:32.879 --> 08:34.160
everything can be discussed.

08:35.080 --> 08:36.519
Fei Ting is way better than you.

08:37.759 --> 08:38.440
What?

08:41.160 --> 08:43.119
I said, my brother-in-law, Fei Ting,

08:43.400 --> 08:44.680
is way better than you.

08:46.160 --> 08:48.160
My sister has better taste
in men than I do.

08:48.999 --> 08:49.800
Wang Tengda,

08:50.004 --> 08:51.040
let me tell you this.

08:51.680 --> 08:53.080
Even if I go to jail,

08:53.080 --> 08:54.382
I would never let my sister

08:54.471 --> 08:55.515
be with someone like you.

08:56.400 --> 08:56.999
Fine.

08:59.560 --> 09:01.320
Then go to jail.

09:01.937 --> 09:02.800
When that happens,

09:02.800 --> 09:05.359
have that cook brother-in-law
of yours bring you meals.

09:05.359 --> 09:06.160
Wang Tengda.

09:08.200 --> 09:09.359
What do you want now?

09:11.359 --> 09:13.239
Lin Mei, you're here.

09:16.239 --> 09:16.920
I'm just

09:17.280 --> 09:18.719
handling this by the book.

09:19.359 --> 09:22.999
Your brother crashed
a Transport Team truck.

09:23.200 --> 09:25.160
If there's no money,

09:25.719 --> 09:27.239
then he'll have to go to jail.

09:28.080 --> 09:28.560
Fine.

09:29.400 --> 09:30.239
By the book, right?

09:30.960 --> 09:31.999
Then let me ask you.

09:33.160 --> 09:34.680
You asked him for the Three Big Items.

09:34.920 --> 09:36.200
Was that by the book?

09:37.560 --> 09:38.639
You talked him into

09:38.800 --> 09:40.719
taking private jobs
in the middle of the night.

09:40.800 --> 09:41.999
Was that by the book?

09:43.200 --> 09:44.280
You want him in jail?

09:44.519 --> 09:45.479
Fine.

09:45.759 --> 09:46.800
But let me tell you,

09:47.200 --> 09:47.879
he can't

09:48.400 --> 09:49.759
keep his mouth shut.

09:49.871 --> 09:51.404
Just like his name.
[* Song can mean "loose" in Chinese]

09:51.560 --> 09:54.160
Once he's at the police station,
he'll spill everything.

09:55.320 --> 09:57.160
Whether you can keep your job

09:57.400 --> 09:58.359
is another question.

10:12.200 --> 10:12.999
Are you trying to...

10:13.879 --> 10:14.920
back out on the deal?

10:15.200 --> 10:16.200
Who's backing out?

10:16.800 --> 10:18.800
No one in the Lin family
backs out on a deal.

10:19.200 --> 10:21.359
But we do need to settle this properly.

10:21.560 --> 10:23.404
First, about my brother
crashing the truck,

10:23.479 --> 10:24.639
you share the blame.

10:25.560 --> 10:27.280
We'll cover the larger share

10:27.680 --> 10:28.800
of the repair costs,

10:28.893 --> 10:30.271
and you cover the smaller share.

10:30.479 --> 10:31.800
We'll pay 450 yuan.

10:32.359 --> 10:33.280
You pay 300 yuan.

10:33.800 --> 10:35.400
Deal, and this is over.

10:35.800 --> 10:37.960
If not, then we take it to court

10:38.440 --> 10:39.599
if we have to,

10:39.999 --> 10:41.160
and face dismissal.

10:41.800 --> 10:42.800
We face the punishment.

10:53.080 --> 10:54.200
Fine, fine.

10:54.920 --> 10:55.999
Guess I'm out of luck.

10:56.119 --> 10:57.280
Hurry up and pay.

10:57.280 --> 10:58.479
It's 450 yuan, and we're done.

10:58.479 --> 10:59.320
Pay up now.

10:59.320 --> 10:59.879
Come on.

11:01.280 --> 11:01.839
Fei Ting.

11:16.119 --> 11:17.080
That's only fifty.

11:19.560 --> 11:21.200
My brother spent 400 yuan

11:21.560 --> 11:23.519
buying you gifts
to get into the Transport Team.

11:23.560 --> 11:24.040
Forgot?

11:24.400 --> 11:25.519
Now he's lost his job.

11:25.800 --> 11:27.200
That 400 yuan was wasted.

11:27.960 --> 11:28.839
We're deducting it.

11:29.080 --> 11:30.119
Now we're even.

11:39.097 --> 11:40.440
Lin Mei, you've got some nerve.

11:40.800 --> 11:42.759
That's not how you settle a debt.

11:43.359 --> 11:44.719
One thing at a time.

11:46.200 --> 11:46.999
Lin Mei,

11:48.560 --> 11:49.800
don't push it.

11:49.800 --> 11:50.839
Who's pushing it?

11:51.359 --> 11:52.560
Who's pushing it?

11:52.800 --> 11:53.960
You took the Three Big Items.

11:54.248 --> 11:55.893
His leg was crippled because of you.

11:55.982 --> 11:58.493
And you have the nerve
to come here asking for money?

11:58.920 --> 11:59.960
Let me tell you,

12:00.080 --> 12:01.440
my wife's just being softhearted.

12:01.680 --> 12:02.479
If it were up to me,

12:02.800 --> 12:04.599
I wouldn't even care about her brother.

12:04.879 --> 12:06.109
I'd let him go to jail,

12:06.110 --> 12:07.693
and you will get fired from the team.

12:07.879 --> 12:08.400
All right?

12:09.599 --> 12:10.320
All right?

12:10.320 --> 12:10.960
Fine.

12:30.359 --> 12:30.999
Let's go.

12:31.639 --> 12:32.280
Lin Mei.

12:38.080 --> 12:39.680
Here, slow down.

12:39.680 --> 12:40.400
Hold it steady.

12:59.560 --> 13:01.519
I'll pay you back that fifty yuan.

13:05.879 --> 13:07.080
Of course, you will.

13:10.400 --> 13:11.680
Once you find a job.

13:19.080 --> 13:19.800
Fei Ting,

13:21.359 --> 13:22.560
is that kitchen helper job

13:23.999 --> 13:25.599
still open?

13:26.999 --> 13:27.680
It is.

13:28.200 --> 13:29.080
Of course, it is.

13:43.222 --> 13:46.960
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

13:46.960 --> 13:47.400
All right.

13:47.639 --> 13:48.519
I'm heading to work.

13:49.479 --> 13:50.320
I'll pick you up.

13:50.320 --> 13:50.759
Okay.

13:50.920 --> 13:51.839
Fei Ni.

13:53.639 --> 13:54.639
Ms. Xu.

13:54.639 --> 13:55.719
Good news.

13:56.479 --> 13:57.280
Great news.

13:57.759 --> 13:58.519
What is it?

14:01.119 --> 14:02.200
Higher education admissions

14:02.639 --> 14:04.719
are undergoing major reforms.

14:06.280 --> 14:07.999
The college entrance exam is back.

14:11.172 --> 14:16.160
(Reform in Higher Education Admissions)
(Implementing Chairman Mao's policy)

14:24.519 --> 14:25.839
I can take the entrance exam.

14:33.280 --> 14:34.200
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

14:34.320 --> 14:35.239
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

14:37.800 --> 14:40.239
Fang Muyang,
I can take the college entrance exam.

15:16.172 --> 15:19.435
(No. 44 Kangnan Road)

15:19.519 --> 15:20.440
That's wonderful.

15:20.604 --> 15:21.893
The college entrance exam

15:21.937 --> 15:22.870
is the fairest way.

15:23.680 --> 15:25.272
If we get in, we enroll.

15:25.519 --> 15:26.359
If we don't,

15:26.359 --> 15:27.280
we keep working at it.

15:27.639 --> 15:28.119
Here.

15:28.759 --> 15:29.479
Fei Ni,

15:29.479 --> 15:32.119
why not apply to
the Math Department at our school?

15:32.320 --> 15:32.999
Mom,

15:33.440 --> 15:34.800
Fei Ni wants to apply for Chinese.

15:35.599 --> 15:37.320
You still have to take math for that.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.479
The subjects are

15:39.599 --> 15:41.839
Chinese, math, politics,
history, and geography.

15:43.040 --> 15:45.200
Mom, I'm fine in the other subjects.

15:45.426 --> 15:46.860
Math is the only one I struggle with.

15:46.920 --> 15:48.320
Could you tutor me?

15:48.800 --> 15:50.800
Don't worry.

15:50.800 --> 15:52.400
You can count on me.

15:52.599 --> 15:53.359
Thanks, Mom.

15:56.080 --> 15:56.719
Fei Ni,

15:57.400 --> 15:58.719
I've gathered all the Chinese

15:58.719 --> 16:00.040
and history materials for you.

16:02.719 --> 16:04.239
That's great. Thank you, Dad.

16:05.440 --> 16:06.400
I couldn't find

16:06.920 --> 16:07.879
these books.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.719
But for the next month,

16:09.879 --> 16:11.320
I'll be your strongest support.

16:11.937 --> 16:12.710
That's enough.

16:12.719 --> 16:13.839
Just behave yourself.

16:13.839 --> 16:15.719
Don't distract Fei Ni from studying.

16:16.047 --> 16:18.110
(Methods of Mathematical Statistics)

16:47.440 --> 16:48.239
Almost done.

17:06.035 --> 17:10.335
♪The melody flows♪

17:10.340 --> 17:14.460
♪Drifting on the breeze♪

17:15.140 --> 17:19.620
♪Fingertips glide across the pages♪

17:19.620 --> 17:22.940
♪Peaceful days unfold♪

17:24.060 --> 17:27.620
♪In a warm embrace♪

17:28.100 --> 17:32.060
♪Holding the comfort of home♪

17:32.620 --> 17:36.340
♪Starlight spills across♪

17:36.485 --> 17:41.085
♪The endless night sky♪

17:41.460 --> 17:45.260
♪Talk a little, listen a little♪

17:45.260 --> 17:49.420
♪Let time settle♪

17:49.900 --> 17:54.060
♪Feel the warm breeze♪

17:54.060 --> 17:58.540
♪Carry us into tomorrow♪

17:59.100 --> 18:02.740
♪When someday, some promise♪

18:02.740 --> 18:07.060
♪Is treasured deep inside our hearts♪

18:07.620 --> 18:12.220
♪It becomes the most beautiful moment♪

18:12.220 --> 18:17.180
♪We pursue together♪

18:18.710 --> 18:23.140
♪And tell who we are now♪

18:23.140 --> 18:29.940
♪That our wish came true♪

18:34.999 --> 18:35.799
Mujing.

18:37.039 --> 18:37.719
Professor Wu.

18:38.440 --> 18:39.440
There's something

18:39.559 --> 18:41.319
I'd like to get your opinion on.

18:41.719 --> 18:42.400
Of course.

18:43.079 --> 18:44.079
The school is planning

18:44.160 --> 18:46.120
to send an outstanding young lecturer

18:46.279 --> 18:48.039
to Germany for further study.

18:49.120 --> 18:51.120
In terms of age, talent, and ability,

18:51.120 --> 18:52.519
you're the top candidate.

18:53.279 --> 18:54.200
Are you interested?

18:54.719 --> 18:55.719
How long would it be?

18:56.279 --> 18:57.319
At least two years.

19:02.880 --> 19:03.680
All right.

19:04.200 --> 19:06.719
I thought you'd give me
an answer right away.

19:09.880 --> 19:10.840
So did I.

19:11.519 --> 19:14.039
No rush. You have half a month.

19:14.519 --> 19:16.319
Think it over and let me know.

19:20.999 --> 19:22.120
Mujing, you've changed.

19:23.039 --> 19:24.360
As a colleague,

19:24.719 --> 19:26.440
I admired the old Fang Mujing.

19:27.039 --> 19:28.440
But as an elder,

19:28.920 --> 19:30.880
I prefer who you are now.

19:32.400 --> 19:33.519
Thank you, Professor Wu.

19:34.470 --> 19:35.315
Get back to work.

20:00.347 --> 20:01.827
When were you planning to tell me?

20:06.048 --> 20:08.090
Or were you going to wait
until the last minute?

20:11.519 --> 20:12.640
How did you find out?

20:14.559 --> 20:16.719
I have more than just you

20:17.239 --> 20:18.400
in the Math Department.

20:21.640 --> 20:23.079
I didn't know how to bring it up.

20:25.648 --> 20:26.790
Then, I'll say it for you.

20:33.600 --> 20:34.719
You're going to Germany.

20:39.840 --> 20:40.640
But...

20:40.719 --> 20:41.759
No more buts.

20:42.160 --> 20:44.030
The fact that
you didn't know how to tell me

20:44.440 --> 20:46.640
is already proof that you love me.

20:48.239 --> 20:49.799
Last time you left me,

20:49.799 --> 20:51.279
you had no hesitation

20:51.600 --> 20:52.680
when you told me.

20:57.799 --> 20:58.479
Qu Hua,

20:59.960 --> 21:01.640
I'm seriously thinking
about giving it up.

21:05.200 --> 21:06.559
The Fang Mujing I know

21:07.519 --> 21:09.960
would never
sacrifice her career for love.

21:11.160 --> 21:13.600
I know you'll struggle
with it until the very end

21:14.120 --> 21:15.440
and still choose to go.

21:16.559 --> 21:17.600
So instead,

21:18.680 --> 21:19.880
let me spare you

21:20.400 --> 21:21.600
all that turmoil.

21:22.360 --> 21:23.880
That way, before you leave,

21:24.160 --> 21:26.400
we can still
spend some happy days together.

21:28.160 --> 21:29.640
Thank you, Qu Hua.

21:42.319 --> 21:43.160
What a pity.

21:44.799 --> 21:45.960
What do you mean?

21:47.079 --> 21:49.239
If I had known
you were going to Germany,

21:50.120 --> 21:51.719
I wouldn't have given up

21:52.200 --> 21:53.640
my own chance to study abroad.

21:57.039 --> 21:59.039
Your hospital offered
to send you to Germany?

22:02.120 --> 22:03.319
But I turned it down.

22:04.200 --> 22:05.440
Because I couldn't leave you.

22:09.440 --> 22:10.160
Qu Hua, I...

22:10.160 --> 22:11.759
The Fang Mujing I love would choose

22:12.360 --> 22:13.640
to go abroad without hesitation.

22:15.039 --> 22:16.519
The one who would refuse to go

22:17.440 --> 22:18.719
is me, who loves Fang Mujing.

22:24.039 --> 22:25.559
We're both just being ourselves.

22:59.085 --> 23:02.960
(Follow the Party's Lead)

23:37.960 --> 23:39.519
(I'll pay double to redeem it.)

23:39.519 --> 23:40.319
(Double. I promise.)

23:40.759 --> 23:42.279
(All right. Deal.)

23:46.271 --> 23:47.990
(You told me
to learn how to do laundry.)

23:47.999 --> 23:49.400
(Is that how I taught you?)

23:49.960 --> 23:50.759
(Stop smiling!)

23:54.035 --> 23:57.460
♪The wind sweeps
through the wheat fields♪

23:58.639 --> 24:01.559
♪Cicadas sing on the treetops♪

24:01.559 --> 24:02.440
(Starting now,)

24:02.440 --> 24:05.719
(I'm going to teach you
some basic life skills.)

24:05.799 --> 24:07.840
(Brushing your teeth,
washing your hair and face,)

24:07.840 --> 24:10.440
(tying your shoelaces,
mending clothes, and doing laundry.)

24:10.440 --> 24:12.799
(From now on,
you'll need to do these yourself.)

24:14.640 --> 24:16.039
(There's a reward if you learn.)

24:17.840 --> 24:18.920
(I want braised pork.)

24:19.071 --> 24:20.826
(Learn it first,
and then you can have it.)

24:20.915 --> 24:24.740
♪Stain the passing years red♪

24:24.910 --> 24:28.550
♪Talk a little, listen a little♪

24:28.760 --> 24:31.920
♪Let time settle♪

24:31.920 --> 24:34.239
(I hope that when we're together,)

24:34.559 --> 24:35.799
(only good things come our way.)

24:35.872 --> 24:37.510
♪Feel the warm breeze♪

24:37.610 --> 24:40.485
♪Carry us into tomorrow♪

24:40.559 --> 24:41.360
(Fang Muyang.)

24:42.160 --> 24:43.600
(We have a home now.)

24:45.200 --> 24:47.039
(My world used to be just me.)

24:47.920 --> 24:48.799
(No one else.)

24:49.799 --> 24:51.319
(But now I have you.)

24:53.440 --> 24:54.600
(Fortunately,)

24:55.519 --> 24:57.920
(you've always been by my side,)

24:58.400 --> 24:59.519
(helping me,)

25:00.493 --> 25:01.510
(and encouraging me.)

25:02.559 --> 25:03.360
(Thank you.)

25:04.799 --> 25:05.640
(Fang Muyang,)

25:06.759 --> 25:08.160
(I really like you.)

25:10.547 --> 25:14.685
♪The melody flows♪

25:14.980 --> 25:18.900
♪Drifting on the breeze♪

25:19.860 --> 25:22.122
♪Fingertips glide across the pages♪

25:22.160 --> 25:23.200
(We have a home again.)

25:24.604 --> 25:26.200
(Like this, I'm not afraid anymore.)

25:27.272 --> 25:27.913
(I want you.)

25:29.039 --> 25:30.440
(I want you to come back safe.)

25:31.799 --> 25:32.680
(I'll wait for you.)

25:33.360 --> 25:34.120
(Fang Muyang.)

25:34.260 --> 25:36.820
♪Let time settle♪

25:39.039 --> 25:39.799
(Fang Muyang.)

25:41.426 --> 25:43.048
(It's so good to have you.)

25:46.180 --> 25:49.820
♪When someday, some promise♪

25:49.820 --> 25:54.180
♪Is treasured deep inside our hearts♪

25:54.700 --> 25:59.380
♪It becomes the most beautiful moment♪

25:59.380 --> 26:04.180
♪We pursue together♪

26:05.660 --> 26:10.580
♪And tell who we are now♪

26:10.580 --> 26:12.799
♪That our wish came true♪

26:12.799 --> 26:13.519
Do you like it?

26:15.440 --> 26:18.200
This is Comrade Fang Muyang's
first solo exhibition.

26:18.759 --> 26:20.319
Every painting here

26:20.319 --> 26:22.039
carries his heart and soul.

26:22.519 --> 26:23.680
Fang Muyang,

26:24.285 --> 26:25.805
I'm grateful you've been with me.

26:26.410 --> 26:29.211
This exhibition is my gift to you.

26:31.799 --> 26:32.640
I love it.

26:34.400 --> 26:35.640
It's my first exhibition,

26:36.600 --> 26:38.039
and the most unforgettable one.

26:43.120 --> 26:43.880
Fei Ni,

26:45.999 --> 26:46.680
thank you.

26:52.559 --> 26:53.440
What if

26:54.804 --> 26:56.360
I take the entrance exam with you?

26:57.960 --> 27:00.120
You want to go to college, too?

27:00.230 --> 27:01.804
I heard that the Literature Department

27:01.915 --> 27:04.160
is next to the Art Department
at Jiangcheng University.

27:04.440 --> 27:05.840
If I get in too,

27:06.039 --> 27:07.960
we could go to class together,

27:08.360 --> 27:09.160
go home together,

27:09.719 --> 27:11.039
eat at the canteen together,

27:11.039 --> 27:13.360
and even study in the library together.

27:14.160 --> 27:15.120
Wouldn't that be great?

27:16.360 --> 27:17.719
Are you sure?

27:18.759 --> 27:19.559
I am.

27:20.279 --> 27:22.120
Going to college isn't really my dream,

27:23.680 --> 27:25.039
but being with you

27:26.360 --> 27:27.559
is what I truly want.

27:41.840 --> 27:42.920
That's wonderful.

27:44.039 --> 27:45.319
I'll resign tomorrow.

27:45.479 --> 27:45.840
Okay.

27:45.840 --> 27:47.759
Then study hard for the exam,

27:48.360 --> 27:49.960
and go to college with you.

27:56.239 --> 27:58.840
- We're going to take
- We're going to take

27:59.279 --> 28:02.239
- the college entrance exam together!
- the college entrance exam together!

28:04.039 --> 28:06.999
We're going to take
the college entrance exam together!

28:11.982 --> 28:14.060
(Formula for the Law of Cosines)
Make sure you remember

28:14.093 --> 28:15.070
how to apply this formula.

28:21.522 --> 28:23.547
(Formula for the Law of Cosines)

28:23.680 --> 28:24.319
Fang Muyang.

28:34.122 --> 28:40.380
♪If the future cannot be grasped♪

28:40.822 --> 28:46.860
♪Don't think too far ahead,
just work hard for today♪

28:47.947 --> 28:54.940
♪Learn from the sun.
Light up the corners that need it♪

28:55.410 --> 29:00.580
♪The ones who smile the most♪

29:00.799 --> 29:02.200
Not bad, you got it right.

29:02.200 --> 29:04.960
♪Live it real♪

29:05.248 --> 29:08.760
♪A down-to-earth life♪

29:08.935 --> 29:15.780
♪Slowly, our paths begin to cross, each
day holds something to look forward to♪

29:15.780 --> 29:22.380
♪Two people, three meals, four seasons♪

29:22.697 --> 29:28.472
♪Collecting ordinary moments in life,
making them into memories♪

29:29.347 --> 29:36.197
♪Time and the wind move slowly,
telling stories of the past♪

29:36.235 --> 29:43.285
♪With you by my side,
that warmth is already the answer♪

29:43.460 --> 29:50.340
♪Live it real, a down-to-earth life♪

29:50.340 --> 29:54.039
♪The cloudy days and rain along the way♪

29:54.040 --> 29:57.515
♪I'll gladly endure anything♪

29:57.560 --> 30:04.220
♪Two people, three meals, four seasons♪

30:04.435 --> 30:10.540
♪Collecting sweet moments in life,
making them into memories♪

30:17.279 --> 30:18.460
It's freezing tonight.

30:23.248 --> 30:24.840
Why did you bring the partition in?

30:25.640 --> 30:26.160
Oh.

30:26.479 --> 30:28.640
To make sure we both get good sleep.

30:28.799 --> 30:30.640
We sleep separately until the exam.

30:34.880 --> 30:36.440
Then why not just

30:36.920 --> 30:38.160
sleep in separate beds?

30:38.400 --> 30:39.160
Exactly.

30:39.759 --> 30:41.279
That was my first thought.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.840
But the place is too small.

30:42.840 --> 30:44.200
We can't fit two beds.

30:44.680 --> 30:46.200
We should've kept

30:46.319 --> 30:47.400
that bunk bed.

30:49.360 --> 30:51.640
It's too cold sleeping alone.

30:52.759 --> 30:54.279
It's warmer squeezing together.

31:00.293 --> 31:01.550
Squeezing together works.

31:03.047 --> 31:03.847
Hold on.

31:04.360 --> 31:06.279
Recite the Pythagorean theorem first.

31:06.279 --> 31:07.400
Then we can sleep together.

31:11.470 --> 31:12.626
The Pythagorean theorem...

31:17.640 --> 31:19.160
Forget it. I'll sleep alone.

31:20.799 --> 31:21.519
Fine.

31:30.559 --> 31:31.360
Forget it.

31:32.680 --> 31:33.880
I'll get up and study.

31:35.790 --> 31:37.204
The Pythagorean theorem, right?

31:38.160 --> 31:39.479
The Pythagorean theorem.

31:42.937 --> 31:43.990
The Pythagorean theorem.

31:46.680 --> 31:47.840
Recite it to me.

31:52.079 --> 31:53.719
A squared

31:53.920 --> 31:55.559
plus B squared...

31:59.737 --> 32:01.270
You just don't want to sleep with me.

32:01.279 --> 32:02.200
Equals C squared.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.840
I've got it. Hurry.

32:03.840 --> 32:05.279
Hey, what are you doing?

32:05.279 --> 32:05.880
Scoot over.

32:05.990 --> 32:06.782
No. Don't push it.

32:07.279 --> 32:07.559
Stop.

32:07.671 --> 32:08.840
That doesn't count.

32:25.840 --> 32:27.039
Go and study hard out there.

32:27.440 --> 32:30.079
When you come back,
I'll be asking you for advice.

32:30.479 --> 32:31.559
Don't worry, Mom.

32:32.279 --> 32:35.200
When dealing with certain people,
don't be too soft.

32:35.230 --> 32:37.471
The nicer you are,
the more they push you around.

32:37.680 --> 32:39.039
Don't worry, Dad.

32:39.840 --> 32:40.640
If you have time,

32:40.640 --> 32:41.848
learn some Western cooking too.

32:42.279 --> 32:43.680
Make it for us when you're back.

32:45.160 --> 32:47.160
Mujing, take care of yourself.

32:48.239 --> 32:49.360
Focus on your exam prep.

32:49.360 --> 32:50.400
You'll get in for sure.

32:52.759 --> 32:53.559
I'm heading out.

32:53.840 --> 32:54.239
Okay.

32:56.960 --> 32:58.440
Mom, Dad, I'll walk her out.

33:07.210 --> 33:11.722
(Jiangcheng Direct to Beijing)

33:23.360 --> 33:25.039
I'm going now.

33:34.999 --> 33:36.680
Don't you have anything to say to me?

33:40.479 --> 33:41.640
Find a bigger place.

33:42.479 --> 33:43.519
One that fits two people.

33:46.600 --> 33:47.469
Our hospital

33:47.470 --> 33:49.604
hasn't officially announced
the sponsored slot yet.

33:49.840 --> 33:51.479
I went back and fought to get it again.

34:31.922 --> 34:39.035
(Jiangcheng)

34:43.972 --> 34:50.210
(1977 Jiangcheng Admissions
No. 2 Secondary School Exam Site)

34:50.272 --> 34:55.422
(Scoring in admissions is our hope.
Welcome, comrades taking the 1977 exam.)

34:55.522 --> 34:57.235
(Scoring in admissions is our hope)

34:57.310 --> 34:59.072
(University, countryside or factories,
study and strive for excellence.)

34:59.119 --> 35:00.079
We'll be waiting for you.

35:00.079 --> 35:00.679
Okay, okay.

35:00.760 --> 35:01.626
Bye, brothers.

35:01.660 --> 35:02.240
Do your best.

35:02.240 --> 35:02.999
You got it.

35:07.697 --> 35:09.685
(No. 2 Secondary School)

35:10.247 --> 35:13.547
(1977 Jiangcheng Admissions
No. 2 Secondary School Exam Site)

35:13.585 --> 35:21.397
(Scoring in admissions is our hope.
Welcome, comrades taking the 1977 exam.)

35:21.440 --> 35:22.039
Fei Ni.

35:22.840 --> 35:23.440
Fei Ni.

35:23.960 --> 35:24.840
Ms. Chen.

35:26.079 --> 35:26.679
Ms. Chen.

35:28.800 --> 35:29.479
Fei Ni,

35:29.880 --> 35:31.679
I came to walk you
into the exam hall today

35:31.679 --> 35:32.880
just to tell you this.

35:33.280 --> 35:34.679
When your heart is clear,

35:34.840 --> 35:36.039
there is nothing more to say.

35:37.159 --> 35:38.240
I believe

35:38.240 --> 35:40.240
none of your hard work will be in vain.

35:42.039 --> 35:42.840
Thank you, Ms. Chen.

35:45.840 --> 35:46.639
Go on.

36:01.360 --> 36:02.199
Fei Ni.

36:43.860 --> 36:45.010
(Welcome, examinees.)

36:45.010 --> 36:46.660
(Archival Footage)

36:46.660 --> 36:48.385
(Reform of the admissions system.)

36:48.385 --> 36:49.772
(University admissions are our hope.)

36:49.772 --> 37:05.922
(Archival Footage)

37:08.679 --> 37:09.599
Fei,

37:09.999 --> 37:11.079
let me test you.

37:11.440 --> 37:13.519
How's my calligraphy?

37:14.800 --> 37:15.639
It's great.

37:15.960 --> 37:16.999
What's great about it?

37:17.679 --> 37:18.240
Well...

37:19.079 --> 37:20.880
"Wind fills the sails."

37:21.119 --> 37:22.320
"Tortoise and Snake stand still."

37:22.320 --> 37:23.715
(Rise to a grand vision)
"Rise to a grand vision."

37:23.840 --> 37:25.800
It's Chairman Mao's poetry.

37:26.079 --> 37:27.400
The meaning is excellent.

37:28.240 --> 37:30.599
And look at these characters.

37:30.599 --> 37:31.280
They're

37:31.720 --> 37:32.880
so rounded.

37:33.199 --> 37:33.920
Right?

37:34.320 --> 37:35.920
And from a distance,

37:35.920 --> 37:37.280
you can see them clearly.

37:37.280 --> 37:39.639
They really stand out.

37:39.639 --> 37:40.599
They're bold.

37:40.999 --> 37:41.559
This stuff

37:41.559 --> 37:43.039
is excellent, truly remarkable.

37:43.039 --> 37:43.760
All right.

37:45.199 --> 37:45.840
Take this.

37:45.840 --> 37:46.720
Sorry to trouble you.

37:47.039 --> 37:48.639
Please pass it to your wife.

37:50.280 --> 37:51.880
Of course, we're family.

37:51.880 --> 37:53.079
Later on,

37:53.079 --> 37:54.119
I'll have it framed.

37:54.119 --> 37:55.880
Dishes are coming.

37:56.559 --> 37:57.720
Here's the fish.

37:58.320 --> 37:59.079
Careful, careful.

37:59.337 --> 38:00.420
Don't spill it on yourself.

38:00.999 --> 38:01.559
Mom, the bowl.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.079
Here.

38:06.800 --> 38:07.280
Mom,

38:07.880 --> 38:08.559
where's Qu Hua?

38:08.960 --> 38:11.630
He's at the hospital, waiting
for Mujing's long-distance call.

38:11.639 --> 38:12.400
Don't wait for him.

38:13.440 --> 38:14.320
Where's Fei Ni?

38:14.840 --> 38:15.920
She's at the gate.

38:15.999 --> 38:18.119
The mailman usually
comes around this time.

38:18.999 --> 38:20.079
She's waiting there.

38:28.519 --> 38:29.360
It's fine.

38:30.280 --> 38:32.039
I believe my daughter

38:32.039 --> 38:33.720
will get into college.

38:33.999 --> 38:34.519
Right.

38:34.519 --> 38:36.400
The entrance exam was
just reinstated this year.

38:36.400 --> 38:37.999
Some of the procedures

38:37.999 --> 38:39.119
aren't running smoothly yet.

38:39.599 --> 38:40.479
How about this?

38:40.479 --> 38:43.079
I'll go to the school tomorrow
and ask about it.

38:43.240 --> 38:43.880
All right.

38:43.999 --> 38:45.280
Then thank you, in-law.

38:45.404 --> 38:46.937
We're family. No need for thanks.

38:47.720 --> 38:49.960
Let me raise a toast

38:50.479 --> 38:52.400
to Comrade Fang Muyang.

38:52.519 --> 38:54.069
Congratulations
to Comrade Fang Muyang

38:54.070 --> 38:56.182
on becoming a student

38:56.293 --> 38:58.590
in the Art Department
of Jiangcheng University.

38:58.999 --> 38:59.880
Congratulations!

39:00.199 --> 39:00.760
Fang,

39:01.720 --> 39:02.960
you're amazing.

39:03.039 --> 39:04.159
My son

39:04.400 --> 39:06.880
has finally made us proud.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.960
Come on.

39:08.960 --> 39:09.800
Congratulations.

39:09.800 --> 39:10.440
Have a drink.

39:10.599 --> 39:11.320
Thank you.

39:11.320 --> 39:13.119
Like father, like son.

39:13.720 --> 39:14.720
Thank you.

39:18.599 --> 39:19.999
There's another piece of good news

39:20.479 --> 39:21.639
for both of you.

39:22.679 --> 39:29.159
I, Fei Mingde, am finally
going to have a grandson.

39:30.880 --> 39:31.479
Really?

39:32.360 --> 39:33.510
It's been over three months.

39:33.510 --> 39:34.960
We waited until it was stabilized.

39:35.071 --> 39:36.240
That's wonderful news.

39:36.599 --> 39:37.079
Great.

39:37.079 --> 39:38.039
We must toast to that.

39:38.039 --> 39:38.999
Yes, yes.

39:38.999 --> 39:39.479
Come on.

39:39.479 --> 39:40.039
Mr. Fang, Mrs. Fang.

39:40.039 --> 39:40.880
Please sit.

39:40.880 --> 39:41.920
Have a seat.

39:42.119 --> 39:43.320
Thank you, Mr. Fang, Mrs. Fang.

39:43.720 --> 39:44.559
Fang,

39:44.720 --> 39:46.199
you and Fei Ni should step it up too.

39:48.760 --> 39:49.559
Step it up.

39:50.079 --> 39:50.559
Sure.

39:50.720 --> 39:51.880
We'll step it up.

39:53.720 --> 39:54.760
- Come on.
- Come on.

39:55.119 --> 39:56.679
I got in. I got in.

39:56.880 --> 39:59.199
Everyone, I got in.

39:59.199 --> 40:00.760
I'm going to college.

40:02.185 --> 40:07.010
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

40:10.800 --> 40:12.999
Let me see!

40:13.599 --> 40:14.119
Come here.

40:14.119 --> 40:14.920
Quick, quick.

40:15.320 --> 40:16.199
Come on.

40:16.199 --> 40:22.285
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

40:22.720 --> 40:23.920
Look how happy he is.

40:23.960 --> 40:28.785
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

40:29.039 --> 40:29.840
Congratulations.

40:30.260 --> 40:34.940
♪In spring, I think of you♪

40:37.800 --> 40:38.639
All right.

40:38.639 --> 40:39.599
Sit down.

40:40.440 --> 40:40.880
Sit.

40:41.048 --> 40:41.590
Let's eat.

40:41.599 --> 40:41.999
Okay.

40:41.999 --> 40:44.119
We have three joyous occasions today.

40:45.159 --> 40:46.079
Fei Ni...

40:46.800 --> 40:47.400
Wonderful.

40:47.400 --> 40:47.880
Congrats.

40:48.079 --> 40:49.240
"Upon approval,

40:49.960 --> 40:51.079
you are admitted

40:51.479 --> 40:55.079
to study Chinese Language and Literature
in the Chinese Department."

40:55.515 --> 40:58.190
(Admission Notice, to Fei Ni)
Please report between March 8, 1978,

40:58.199 --> 40:59.320
and March 10...

40:59.440 --> 41:00.679
That's next week.

41:01.519 --> 41:04.079
"Present this notice upon registration."

41:04.079 --> 41:06.360
- Splendid!
- Wonderful!

41:08.660 --> 41:15.100
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

41:15.797 --> 41:22.797
♪You belong to me, you see the light♪

41:23.110 --> 41:30.485
♪Remember, that's me,
thinking of you♪

41:38.322 --> 41:41.797
(A warm welcome to new students.)

41:41.835 --> 41:43.672
(New Student Registration)

41:43.710 --> 41:46.585
(Restore and strengthen
key national universities.)

41:46.635 --> 41:49.160
(Develop academic activities
and advance scientific endeavors.)

41:49.160 --> 41:51.422
(A warm welcome to new students.)

41:51.422 --> 41:55.485
(Jiangcheng University)

42:09.810 --> 42:22.999
(Jiangcheng University)
(A warm welcome to new students.)

42:22.999 --> 42:26.360
(There is always a beam of light
that breaks through confusion.)

42:26.999 --> 42:28.920
(We call it a dream.)

42:29.471 --> 42:31.871
(This light once traveled across time,)

42:32.039 --> 42:33.840
(illuminating countless journeys.)

42:34.160 --> 42:37.848
(Growing alongside New China,
their dreams)

42:38.240 --> 42:41.772
(were sparks flying
from torrents of steel.)

42:42.039 --> 42:45.199
(They were golden waves rolling
across vast fertile fields,)

42:46.079 --> 42:49.240
(were the constant roar
of factory machines,)

42:49.240 --> 42:51.020
(and were the eyes)

42:51.020 --> 42:53.440
(yearning for knowledge
under the oil lamp late at night.)

42:54.159 --> 42:55.639
(Even when material life was scarce)

42:55.800 --> 42:57.039
(and fate unpredictable,)

42:57.119 --> 42:58.880
(they never wavered.)

42:59.479 --> 43:02.280
(Scoring in admissions is our hope.)
(Believing that knowledge)

43:02.280 --> 43:04.048
(would one day clear the fog ahead.)

43:04.582 --> 43:05.982
(A warm welcome to new students.)

43:06.272 --> 43:14.610
(The End)

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
